%N A136344 Least primes p1 such that gap between p1 and p2=nextprime(p1) contains no semiprimes. Gap is 1 for n=0 (first term) and 2n for n>0.
%C A136344 Notice that terms are not necessarily monotonically increasing.
%e A136344 a(0)=2 because gap=3-2=1 and between 2 and 3 there is no semiprimes,
%e A136344 a(1)=11 because gap=11-13=2 and between 11 and 13 there is no semiprimes,
%e A136344 a(2)=97 because gap=97-101=4 and between 97 and 101 there is no semiprimes,
%e A136344 a(30)=9042022037 because gap=9042022037-9042022097=60 and between 9042022037 and 9042022097 there is no semiprimes.
%Y A136344 Cf. A133478.
